{"parse": {"title": "初阶秘物匣子", "pageid": 2156, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"初阶秘物匣子\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e1/Item-481001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"初阶秘物匣子\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>初阶秘物匣子</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#481005</div></div><hr /><div>神秘学家都熟悉的小匣子。开启后可从中挑选指定的初阶材料，用于角色的洞悉与共鸣。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">无论你需不需要，它都不算太贵重。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">内含</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110101\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A2%A4%E9%A2%A4%E4%B9%8B%E9%BD%BF\" title=\"颤颤之齿\"><img alt=\"Bgequip2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Bgequip2.png/100px-Bgequip2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Bgequip2.png/150px-Bgequip2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Bgequip2.png/200px-Bgequip2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A2%A4%E9%A2%A4%E4%B9%8B%E9%BD%BF\" title=\"颤颤之齿\"><img alt=\"颤颤之齿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/Item-110101.png/100px-Item-110101.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/Item-110101.png/150px-Item-110101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/Item-110101.png/200px-Item-110101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A2%A4%E9%A2%A4%E4%B9%8B%E9%BD%BF\" title=\"颤颤之齿\">颤颤之齿</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">不断颤抖的牙齿。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110201\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8B%A6%E7%9B%90%E7%B0%87\" title=\"苦盐簇\"><img alt=\"Bgequip2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Bgequip2.png/100px-Bgequip2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Bgequip2.png/150px-Bgequip2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Bgequip2.png/200px-Bgequip2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8B%A6%E7%9B%90%E7%B0%87\" title=\"苦盐簇\"><img alt=\"苦盐簇\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Item-110201.png/100px-Item-110201.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Item-110201.png/150px-Item-110201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Item-110201.png/200px-Item-110201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltip